description=Optional KI5 F700 support for Mobile Living 3.10.2 (B42.20, Multiplayer): Bank adds seven living positions. SWAT converts six original rear seats; School, Prison and Military Buses convert fourteen rear seats. Each converted position has one row, accepting either its native driver-style seat or living equipment. All models have four overhead positions; Bank/SWAT have two water tanks and Buses have four. Bus roof cans and generators use the shared service menus. / Mobile Living 3.10.2 可选 KI5 F700 适配（B42.20，多人）：Bank 新增七个生活位；SWAT 改装原后排六座；校车、囚车、军用 Bus 改装原后排十四座。每位显示一行，同车型驾驶座椅与生活设备二选一。均有四个顶部空间；Bank／SWAT 两水箱，Bus 四水箱。Bus 原车顶油罐和发电机共用主模块快捷菜单。 / Mobile Living 3.10.2 可選 KI5 F700 適配（B42.20，多人）：Bank 新增七個生活位；SWAT 改裝原後排六座；校車、囚車、軍用 Bus 改裝原後排十四座。每位顯示一行，同車型駕駛座椅與生活設備二選一。均有四個頂部空間；Bank／SWAT 兩水箱，Bus 四水箱。Bus 原車頂油罐和發電機共用主模組快捷選單。
